message:
Empty coupon code crashed checkout because `apply_coupon` did a bare `COUPONS[code]` dict lookup — a `KeyError` on `""` or any unknown code propagated unhandled through `cart.total()`. Fixed by adding an explicit guard that raises `ValueError("Invalid coupon code: ...")` before the lookup. Added `tests/test_issue_1.py`; full suite green (36 passed).
@m13-ops-maint
